[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3979815564","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116923#issuecomment-3979815564","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116923","id":3979815564,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7tNyqM","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-01T11:50:22Z","updated_at":"2026-03-01T11:53:07Z","body":"This absolutely breaks compatibility, this is fully accessible, through `parameters/looping` on the player node, and is stored in files, so changing this will break existing projects and code accessing this\r\n\r\nThe fact that it doesn't have an explicit setter/getter method is irrelevant, tons of properties do, the fact that it isn't documented is a limitation of the documentation system, see:\r\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115864\r\n\r\nI'd also say the rename is misleading, it's not the property itself that is the override, the property *has* an override as part of the way the UI works","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3979815564/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3979908743","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116923#issuecomment-3979908743","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116923","id":3979908743,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7tOJaH","user":{"login":"Akosmo","id":95504962,"node_id":"U_kgDOBbFKQg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95504962?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo","html_url":"https://github.com/Akosmo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-01T12:55:01Z","updated_at":"2026-03-01T12:55:01Z","body":"> This absolutely breaks compatibility, this is fully accessible, through `parameters/looping` on the player node, and is stored in files, so changing this will break existing projects and code accessing this\r\n\r\nI'm aware it's accessible on the node, which is how I tested, but I didn't know about the property being stored in files as `looping`.\r\n\r\n> The fact that it doesn't have an explicit setter/getter method is irrelevant, tons of properties do...\r\n\r\nI know they have, I just assumed a property is only supposed to be documented if they can be set/get, which this one doesn't. My apologies\r\n\r\n> I'd also say the rename is misleading, it's not the property itself that is the override, the property _has_ an override as part of the way the UI works\r\n\r\nI'm a little confused. Toggling on \"Looping\" (as the property is originally named in the inspector) already overrides the `loop` property set in import, regardless of what the checkbox on its right is set to.\r\nIf you click that checkbox on the right first, that will set the one to the left (\"Looping\") to true. Clicking it again won't undo that, so the override is still in effect.\r\n\r\nI read through the PR you linked. Should we leave this property named as is, and wait for #115253 ?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3979908743/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3979916512","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116923#issuecomment-3979916512","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116923","id":3979916512,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7tOLTg","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-01T12:59:47Z","updated_at":"2026-03-01T13:00:58Z","body":"Changing the name wouldn't necessarily help IMO as it still doesn't explain the two checkboxes\r\n\r\nThe property is set through the `set_parameter` and is passed from players through the normal `set` method, it can be fully set, you just use `my_player.set(\"parameters/looping\", true)`, this is equivalent to `AnimationPlayer`\r\n\r\nFor the user interface the UI is a bit convoluted, but arguably the right hand side checkbox is this property, the left one is part of the editor interface like that for theme overrides\r\n\r\nBut regardless of interpretation this still would break existing files, and code, at minimum we'd need to add compatibility code to catch `looping` and just translate that to access the new name, but that's a lot of additional code for this change ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3979916512/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3979945515","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116923#issuecomment-3979945515","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116923","id":3979945515,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7tOSYr","user":{"login":"Akosmo","id":95504962,"node_id":"U_kgDOBbFKQg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95504962?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo","html_url":"https://github.com/Akosmo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-01T13:20:07Z","updated_at":"2026-03-01T13:20:07Z","body":"I didn't know that was possible. Thank you so much for clarifying that to me.\r\n\r\nClosing. Reason: #115864 (comments)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3979945515/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]